message: "If you use this replication kit, please cite the FDS-G1 Complete Series."
title: "FDS-G1 Complete Series: Replication Kit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Wu"
    given-names: "Y."
repository-code: "https://github.com/yiningwu-research/fds-g1-replication-kit"
abstract: "Machine-readable specification, benchmark outputs, reference implementation, and KiDS-1000 shear-only diagnostic layer for the FDS-G1 finite-screen gravity program. Includes model cards, prior definitions, likelihood conventions, validation tests, a D7 finite Markov-screen toy model, and the v1.1 KiDS-1000 CLASS-based shear-only stress tests with nuisance profiling, adversarial controls, and deterministic mock-injection false-positive audit."
keywords:
  - "cosmology"
  - "dark energy"
  - "modified gravity"
  - "nested sampling"
  - "model comparison"
  - "finite screen gravity"
  - "weak lensing"
  - "KiDS-1000"
license: MIT
